      "message": "fix(app): the span-sized lattice is only for the empty plan; pin the no-stock refusal\n\nReview of #599: the guard now falls back only on exactly +inf (no tool\ncut); a NaN or negative radius still reaches auto_cell and is refused\nby name. The no-stock test requires the by-name 'no stock' refusal\ninstead of passing on an empty note.\n\nRefs #592\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
